      "dialogue": "周成：包還在前站旁邊。裡面沒什麼值錢的，只是我媽替我塞了一件外套。\n阿遠：你先坐著。我找到就帶過來，順便把這箱水送去。",
      "completion_dialogue": "周成：就是這件。她嫌我老是穿太薄……水放旁邊吧，還有人沒喝。",
      "reward": {"parts_vouchers": 140, "evidence_score": 0, "community_trust": 5, "rescued_bonus": 0, "achievement": "backpack_home"},
      "objectives": [
        {"key": "backpack", "text": "到前站外拾回周成的背包。", "event": "collect_item", "targets": ["SIDE_007_backpack"], "required": 1, "world_kind": "item"},
        {"key": "water", "text": "從轉運站領一箱飲用水。", "event": "collect_item", "targets": ["SIDE_007_water"], "required": 1, "world_kind": "item"},
        {"key": "supply", "text": "把背包與飲用水送到周成所在的安全集合點。", "event": "deliver_supply", "targets": ["SIDE_007_safe"], "required": 1, "world_kind": "contact"}
      ]
    },
    {
